# AMX Mod X admins for both servers. Copy to admins.env (not in git) and
# add yours there. After changing: docker compose up -d
# (no rebuild needed; "restart" does not re-read this file).
#
# Comma separated list, each entry one of:
#   name:password          by player name + password. The player sets the
#                          password once in the game console:
#                            setinfo _pw "password"
#   name                   by player name only, no password
#                          (careful: anyone using that name is admin)
#   192.168.1.10           by IP address
#
# Optionally append :flags to restrict rights (default: all), e.g.
#   name:password:abcdefghijkmnopqrstu   (all but rcon)
#   name::cfj                            (name only: kick, map, vote)
#   192.168.1.10:cfj
# Flags: a immunity, b reserved slot, c kick, d ban, e slay, f map, g cvar,
# h cfg, i chat, j vote, k sv_password, l rcon, m-t custom, u menu.
# No commas, colons or double quotes in names and passwords.
#
# Example: CS_ADMINS=Alice:secret, 192.168.1.10, Bob:pw123:cfju

CS_ADMINS=
